  "name": "Bloodmail 6-piece stacks Fateful Harvest on nearby deaths (#12204)",
  "contract": [
    "#12204: the Bloodmail 6-piece bonus 823733 reads 'Whenever a nearby enemy dies, your critical strike chance",
    "increases by 1%. Stacks up to 7 times and lasts 20 sec.' CoA's tier set harvest (AscensionTierSetHarvest)",
    "already grants each listed bonus's trigger spell to every player within 40 yards when a hostile creature",
    "dies; the Beaststalker, The Elements and Valor bonuses use the same Fateful Harvest buff 823701, but 823733",
    "was not listed, so the Bloodmail kill buff never appeared. A Mage kills a dummy before the bonus is applied",
    "(CONTROL: no stack), then two dummies with only 823733 on: the first kill gives one stack of 823701 and the",
    "second two. Before the repair both kills with the bonus leave 823701 absent, so the discriminating checks",
    "fail."
  ],
